		{
			dependencies: ["7B00000000000008"]
			description: [
				"&eEnergizing Rods&r are what actually deliver power to the Energizing Orb. The Orb is only the crafting surface; the rods are the machine."
				""
				"&e&lMore rods, and higher tier rods, mean faster crafts.&r A single Basic rod will technically complete a recipe eventually. Six Nitro rods will do it before you have walked away."
				""
				"&e&lPlace them around the Orb&r with a clear line to it, and feed them with cable. The Orb's GUI shows total input rate - use it to check whether adding rods is actually helping."
				""
				"&7Late Powah recipes want enormous energy per craft. This is where an Energy Cell bank pays off, discharging into the rods far faster than your generators could directly.&r"
			]
			icon: "powah:energizing_rod_basic"
			id: "7B00000000000009"
			rewards: [{
